  <!-- ============ NON-PROFIT MISSION ============ -->
  <section class="page-section page-section--narrow">
    <header class="page-section__head">
      <p class="page-section__kicker">501(c)(3) Non-Profit</p>
      <h2 class="page-section__title">Our <em>Mission</em></h2>
      <hr class="page-section__rule">
    </header>

    <div class="mission-block">
      <p>
        CreArtBox Inc. is a <strong>501(c)(3) non-profit organization</strong> founded in New York City in 2013 and dedicated to producing innovative live chamber music performances that weave together classical repertoire, newly commissioned works, and the visual arts.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our work is to make world-class performances accessible to everyone, regardless of economic circumstance - to encourage the creation of new multidisciplinary work, to support professional artists, and to nurture future generations through educational and community outreach.
      </p>
      <p>
        The organization is led by a small, committed <strong>Board of Directors</strong>, guided by an Advisory Board of distinguished artists, and governed in accordance with the laws of the State of New York.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

